'''Summon Greater Harbinger of Directions''' is a [[skill]] granted by {{il|The Shattered Divinity}}. 

==Skill Functions and Interactions==
The summoned Harbinger is immortal, and occasionally casts ''The Shattered Divinity'' on the player. ''The Shattered Divinity'' is a [[buff]] that lasts 4 seconds, with a cooldown of 4 seconds, and grants one or all of the following benefits:
* 2 additional Projectiles
* +2 [[Chain]]s
* [[Pierce]] 2 additional Targets
* Projectiles Fork then Fork an additional time

